    @endforeach

    {{ $row['from'] - $row['sentAt'] }} 
    {{ $row['to'] - $row['doneAt'] }} 
@endforeach
```

This ensures that even if `status` is not an array, it defaults to an empty array, preventing the "Trying to access array offset on value of type int" error.

