Here are a few steps to troubleshoot and resolve this:

1. **Ensure Correct Route Setup**: Make sure your routes are properly defined in `routes/web.php`:
    ```php
    use App\Http\Livewire\Account;

    Route::get('/account', Account::class)->name('account');
