    @endif

    {{ $row['from'] - $row['sentAt'] }} 
    {{ $row['to'] - $row['doneAt'] }} 
@endforeach
```

By adding the `is_array($row['status'])` check, you ensure that only when `$row['status']` is an array, it will be iterated over. This prevents the error from occurring and ensures your code runs smoothly.

