    if(trimmed.substr(3,2)!=="")
      numbers.push(trimmed.substr(3,3));
    if(trimmed.substr(6,3)!="")
      numbers.push(trimmed.substr(6,4));

    input.value = numbers.join('-');

    // Trigger change detection
    this.changeDetectorRef.detectChanges();
  }
}
```

This ensures that the reactive form control's value is updated and its validators are re-evaluated correctly.

