The CORS issue you're encountering is due to a redirect happening during the preflight `OPTIONS` request, which is not allowed by default in CORS policy. To resolve this, ensure no redirects occur in your `handleCorsPreflight` method:

```php
public function handleCorsPreflight()
{
    return response(null, 200)
        ->header('Access-Control-Allow-Origin', '*')
        ->header('Access-Control-Allow-Methods', 'POST, GET, OPTIONS, PUT, DELETE')
        ->header('Access-Control-Allow-Headers', 'Content-Type, Authorization');
}
```

Additionally, ensure your routes are correctly set up to handle `OPTIONS` requests:

