```

To open this component as a dialog, you can use Angular's `Modal` service or any third-party library like `ngx-bootstrap`, `ng-zorro-antd`, etc. For simplicity, let’s assume you are using a basic modal approach:

```typescript
// app.component.ts
import { Component } from '@angular/core';
import { MyStandaloneDialogComponent } from './my-standalone-dialog.component';

@Component({
  selector: 'app-root',
  template: `
    <button (click)="openDialog()">Open Dialog</button>
  `,
})
