  openDialog() {
    const dialogRef = document.createElement('my-standalone-dialog');
    document.body.appendChild(dialogRef);
    // Optionally, you can add styles or other configurations here.
  }
}
```

This example demonstrates creating and appending the standalone component directly to the DOM. Adjustments might be needed based on your specific requirements and any additional features like styling or closing mechanisms.

For more advanced dialog implementations, consider using Angular's `Modal` service from a library like `ngx-bootstrap`.

