@NgModule({
  imports: [],
  declarations: [ProductListComponent],
  providers: [
    provideHttpClient(withHttpParamsCodec),
  ],
})
export class AppModule {}
```

By providing `HttpClient` this way, Angular will be able to inject it into your services and components correctly.

