1. Update the type of `posts` in your component to include `null`:
   ```typescript
   posts: any[] | null = [];
   ```

2. Modify the template to use optional chaining (`?.`) when accessing properties that might be undefined or null:
   ```html
   @for(post of posts; track post.title){
     @if(post?.id % 2 == 0){
       {{post?.id}}-{{post?.title}} 
     }
